Water... I'm so thristy.

I have to be quiet so no one will see me awake.

GHOST: Run... little one... you must run...

GHOST: The sea... the sea is coming to claim the valley! 
GHOST: It is angry! The shelter will not hold! 
GHOST: Do not trust the trees... the surge will swallow them whole! 
GHOST: Take your siblings and run to the hills... before the dawn breaks!

The sea? But the sea is far away behind the highway. 

How can it come here to the valley? 

But Tatay said the trees are strong...

They're protecting us..

...

Who is telling the truth?


